target
id*
db*
# db_v2.sqlite3 is committed on purpose: sqlx's compile-time query! macros
# (see src/database.rs) open it via DATABASE_URL in .env to validate SQL
# against its schema at build time. It's schema-only (no peer data) and
# regenerated by running the server once against an empty directory.
!db_v2.sqlite3
debian-build
debian/.debhelper
debian/debhelper-build-stamp
.DS_Store
.vscode
src/version.rs
test.*
.idea
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
